Package: Satisficing
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Detecting Indicators of Survey Satisficing
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Sohei", "Ide", email = "sohei@ni.tama.ac.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for detecting potential indicators of satisficing in
    survey responses, including straight-line response patterns and row-wise
    evaluation of logical conditions, as well as careless and insufficient
    effort response indices ported from the 'careless' package (including
    longstring, intra-individual response variability, even-odd consistency,
    psychometric synonyms/antonyms, and Mahalanobis distance).
